# Local agent instructions (internal, not published).
# AGENTS.md is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the canonical, durable agent spec for this repo and is
# tracked in git, so it survives a clean checkout and is not lost when the scratch folder is cleared.
# A root-level `agent.md` is ignored because it invites the exact confusion AGENTS.md exists to avoid.
CLAUDE.md
agent.md
.claude/
.cursor/
.opencode/

